# A walk through the bank for the Captures workflow: one simulator run,
# one PNG per snap, walk.mp4 of the whole thing. The viewer starts on the
# shader named by SHADERBANK_SHADER (see the env hook in main.lua). Keys
# step within a category (left/right) and the viewer prints "name: <shader>"
# on every switch; a tap on the segmented control prints "[SHADERBANK] tab"
# and opens that category's list, and a row tap loads that shader. Tabs are
# tapped on their lower half: the control swallows taps on the label area of
# its first two segments without firing (engine delivery verified; widget
# quirk).
fail ERROR: Runtime error
wait 6000
snap generator-balatro
key right
expect name:
wait 800
snap generator-next
tap 120 25
expect [SHADERBANK] tab 2 Filter
tap 160 73
wait 1500
snap filter
tap 200 25
expect [SHADERBANK] tab 3 F_Trans
tap 160 103
wait 1500
snap ftrans
tap 280 25
expect [SHADERBANK] tab 4 Composite
tap 160 73
wait 1500
snap composite
